write('architecture/architecture-overview.md',`# Architecture overview\n\nThe frozen product commit ${PRODUCT} implements an ingestion-to-provenance pipeline. The code-verified mapping is in \`module-to-code-map.csv\`; the diagram is in \`architecture-overview.mmd\`. The evaluation harness supplies the final structured-answer and judge layers without changing the product retrieval implementation.`);
write('architecture/retrieval-pipeline.md',`# Retrieval pipeline\n\nThe product combines temporal parsing, text/vector/assertion/graph candidate channels, reciprocal-rank fusion, readable evidence grouping, the existing LLM reranker, Evidence Selector v2, and a bounded Answer Top-10. Source traces preserve channel, rank, and evidence IDs. The final fix changed selection and fusion behavior, not the embedding model or benchmark data.`);
write('architecture/evidence-selector.md',`# Evidence Selector v2\n\nThe selector is implemented in \`brain-server/src/retrieval/evidence-selector.ts\` and called from \`brain-server/src/api/handlers/mcp.ts\`. It detects query intent, groups fused evidence, isolates raw-event channels, applies query-aware temporal options, and selects a diverse set while penalizing support-only or relationship-only graph noise. Runtime attestation fixes selector SHA-256 to \`a37bbdcf589265db73d639c1b8b6c58a2baabee0e70537d6ecd860c9b928b949\`.`);
write('architecture/runtime-attestation.md',`# Runtime attestation\n\nThe final preflight machine manifest verifies product commit ${PRODUCT}, clean product worktree, build SHA-256 ${BUILD_SHA}, Evidence Selector v2 SHA-256, local E5 Large load, model hash, 1024-dimensional output, and healthy indexes before scenario execution. Source: \`${repoPath('05-retrieval-preflight-round-1/manifest.json')}\`.`);
const diffStat=execFileSync('git',['-C',path.join(local,'..','product'),'diff','--stat',`${PRODUCT_INITIAL}..${PRODUCT}`],{encoding:'utf8'}).trim();
write('architecture/final-product-fix.md',`# Final product fix\n\n## What failed\n\nThe initial frozen product executed the selector but allowed selected graph/support noise to displace query-bearing facts. Machine diagnosis classified this as \`PRODUCT_RETRIEVAL_DEFECT / SELECTOR_EXECUTED_BUT_SELECTED_GRAPH_NOISE\`. Initial retrieval preflight Top-10 slot coverage was 20/38 (failed); after one product fix round it was 37/38 (passed).\n\n## Verified diff\n\nFrom ${PRODUCT_INITIAL} to ${PRODUCT}:\n\n\`\`\`text\n${diffStat}\n\`\`\`\n\nChanged production files: \`brain-server/src/api/handlers/mcp.ts\`, \`brain-server/src/retrieval/evidence-selector.ts\`, and \`brain-server/src/retrieval/fusion.ts\`. Regression coverage was added in \`brain-server/tests/api.smoke.test.ts\` and \`brain-server/tests/evidence-selector.test.ts\`. The changes generalize query-aware grouping/selection and source-aware fusion; inspection found no Scenario-ID hard-coding and no Gold-answer reads in the product diff. Product tests passed 329/329.\n\n## Before/after evidence\n\n- Preflight: 20/38 to 37/38 Top-10 slots.\n- The preserved earlier Targeted infrastructure failure was 0/7 and was not counted as a product validation opportunity. The fresh, preflight-gated Targeted-7 completed 7/7 at ${targetedSummary.overall}, with Candidate Pool, Final-20, and Answer Top-10 each 28/30.\n\nThis is a factual internal-benchmark improvement, not an external generalization claim.`);
json('architecture/method-facts.json',{schema_version:1,frozen_product_commit:PRODUCT,facts:[{id:'M1',fact:'Events are extracted into temporal graph facts and embeddings.',code:['brain-server/src/api/handlers/ingest.ts','brain-server/src/graphrag/llm-pipeline.ts']},{id:'M2',fact:'Retrieval combines vector, text, assertion, raw-event, and graph channels.',code:['brain-server/src/api/handlers/mcp.ts']},{id:'M3',fact:'Candidate lists use reciprocal-rank fusion with source traces.',code:['brain-server/src/retrieval/fusion.ts']},{id:'M4',fact:'Evidence Selector v2 groups and query-selects evidence before Answer Top-10.',code:['brain-server/src/retrieval/evidence-selector.ts','brain-server/src/api/handlers/mcp.ts']},{id:'M5',fact:'Embedding preflight verifies local E5 Large, pinned revision/hash, and 1024 dimensions.',evidence:repoPath('05-retrieval-preflight-round-1/manifest.json')}]});

